ng, while the updated kitchen offers quartz counters, SS appliances, ample cabinetry, a wi pantry & direct access to the backyard. A spacious primary bedrm, additional bedroom & 4pc bath complete the main level. Downstairs offers a massive rec room, full bath & flex room w/ the potential to be converted into an additional bedroom. Outside, the south-facing backyard offers a large deck, newer fencing, concrete walkways & an oversized 25x23 double detached garage. Additional upgrades include A/C, updated windows & more. Located close to schools, shopping, parks & w/ quick access to major routes. Some photos are virtually staged. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$439,998"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","962 sq ft"],["Year built","1955"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Argyll"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6E0L2"],["MLS® number","E4506637"],["Listed","September 2, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Freezer, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.53 m × 6.76 m (14'10\" × 22'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.37 m × 4.15 m (7'9\" × 13'7\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.56 m × 3.01 m (8'5\" × 9'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.49 m × 4.34 m (11'5\" × 14'3\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.46 m × 3.00 m (11'4\" × 9'10\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","11.58 m × 6.70 m (38'0\" × 22'0\")"]],"courtesy":"Brad Smith, Royal LePage Prestige Realty and Marissa MacIntyre, Royal LePage Prestige Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"argyll","area":"southeast-edmonton"}